            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "My initial response was going to suggest using appropriate \"paragraph without trailing whitespace\" textobject (instead of `ip`). For example, created with 'mini.ai'. This approach is still valid and will work.\r\n\r\nHowever, I *think* there is a special handling of first line indent (which is essentially a leading whitespace) when adding surrounding. So if there is, it is reasonable to add a special handling of trailing whitespace at the last line.\r\n\r\nI'll take a closer look once I have access to a fully functioning Neovim instance.",
